  /** A node of the AST. Wraps the JSON object that astgen wrote; accessors decode it lazily.
    *
    * Two nodes are equal if they wrap the very same JSON object (so reading a child twice yields equal nodes), and
    * hashing is cheap: neither looks at the content of the subtree.
    */
